{"hymn":"S230","parent":"E284","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Me amó con un amor","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Amados por el Señor","syl":{"n1":"Me","n2":["a","i"],"n3":["mó","t"],"n4":"con","n5":"un","n6":["a","i"],"n7":["mor","t"],"n8":"Tan","n9":["di","i"],"n10":["vi","m"],"n11":["no‿y","t"],"n12":["e","i"],"n13":["ter","m"],"n14":["nal,","t"],"n15":"Por","n16":"Su","n17":["gra","i"],"n18":["cia","t"],"n19":["su","i"],"n20":["pe","t"],"n21":"yo","n22":["De‿es","i"],"n23":["ta","t"],"n24":["gran","i"],"n25":["de","t"],"n26":["rea","i"],"n27":["li","m"],"n28":["dad.","t"],"n29":"¡Oh,","n30":["com","i"],"n31":["ple","m"],"n32":["ta‿y","t"],"n33":["dul","i"],"n34":["ce","t"],"n35":"paz!","n36":"¡Me","n37":["trans","i"],"n38":["por","m"],"n39":["ta","t"],"n40":["to","i"],"n41":["do‿el","t"],"n42":"ser!","n43":"En","n44":["a","i"],"n45":["mor","t"],"n46":"tan","n47":["ce","i"],"n48":["les","m"],"n49":["tial,","t"],"n50":["Su","i"],"n51":["yo","t"],"n52":"soy","n53":"y","n54":["mí","i"],"n55":["o‿es","t"],"n56":"Él.","n57":"En","n58":["a","i"],"n59":["mor","t"],"n60":"tan","n61":["ce","i"],"n62":["les","m"],"n63":["tial,","t"],"n64":["Su","i"],"n65":["yo","t"],"n66":"soy","n67":"y","n68":["mí","i"],"n69":["o‿es","t"],"n70":"Él."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Es el cielo más azul,","Y la tierra un verde mar;","Algo vibra en todo aquí,","Pues mi ser en Cristo está.","Dan las aves su canción,","Y las flores, brillantez,","Desde que conozco yo,","Que soy Suyo‿y mío‿es Él."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Lo que antes me alarmó","No me puede perturbar;","En Su seno de amor","Yo me calmo‿en dulce paz.","Quiero‿aquí permanecer","Renunciando a mi avidez;","Mientras le oigo susurrar","Suyo soy y mío‿es Él."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Para siempre suyo soy,","¿Qué nos puede separar?","Cristo en mi corazón,","¡Oh que gran felicidad!","Puede‿el cosmos terminar,","O el alba oscurecer,","Pero‿estando yo con Dios","Suyo soy y mío es Él."]}]}